From: medyma <medyma@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mt_wifi7: include the shared OSAL PMKSA declarations

Do not toggle CFG80211_SUPPORT after rt_config.h has already included the
OSAL cfg80211 header. Its include guard makes that second include a no-op.
Use the shared PMKSA header without enabling legacy cfg80211 code.

--- a/mt_wifi/sta/sta_cfg.c
+++ b/mt_wifi/sta/sta_cfg.c
@@ -28 +28,4 @@
 #include	"rt_config.h"
+#ifdef MT_WIFI_OSAL_SUPPORT
+#include <mt_osal_pmksa.h>
+#endif
